{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_06_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_06","title":"領主宅邸攻防戰","storyCode":"OD-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"641465314cd69baa227e6eaf417a8c286feaae3fc4c972db3906334fcb2d8a49","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"長泉鎮領主衛隊長十分強橫並且難以溝通，她下令驅逐羅德島幹員與虹彩小隊幹員，並且帶走了所有的感染者。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有多久沒見面了，我親愛的妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半年，一年，還是更久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德魯奇，你襲擊領主衛隊，攻佔領主府邸，這是在謀反！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謀反，哼，呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該知道，皮加爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是老頭子那腐朽的腦袋裡還想著保護他那些感染的......啊，劣質資產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位子根本輪不到你坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點，妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這個，這些玩具來自一位哥倫比亞的熱心贊助商。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"狡猾的瑞柏巴敲了敲自己身後的設備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"TSW-2號超聲波衝擊裝置，高科技工業產品，尚未投入實戰的實驗武器，唯一的缺點是尺寸太大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把它藏在鎮子裡，可是花了不少時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你從大宅裡騙出來，也花了我不少時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我親愛的妹妹，你那強大的武技起到什麼作用了？你堅強的意志又起到什麼作用了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再看看這些朋友，這些薩卡茲朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們可不是那些死腦筋的魔族佬，他們同樣來自哥倫比亞，他們為錢辦事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道這代表著什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們代表著更先進的東西，是你和老頭子永遠都不會明白的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要利潤夠高，金錢能匯聚的力量遠超你的想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子堅持的那些狗屁不通的道理，現在又到哪兒去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，我們在一間大房子裡找到了這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，巴耶勒王酋的領主委任書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"細紋草紙，繡邊簽名，磚塊一樣的巴耶勒文，還有這黝黑蓋章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我們找遍了所有房間，大宅裡只有一大群鎮民，沒看到你說的老頭子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親已經過世了，現在我就是長泉鎮的領主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你違抗領主，就是違抗王酋，你已經死罪難逃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你和那個老東西想出來的計謀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老東西真的是越來越蠢了。你們居然覺得依靠王酋就能將我一軍，你真的是天真得可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子引以為豪的瑞柏巴衛隊現在就躺在巷子裡身首異處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最棘手的領主衛隊已經沒了，你覺得這裡還有誰能管我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個喪心病狂的廢物！他們從小看著你長大！你竟然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不該擋我的道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不該。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在我們血脈相連的份上，我就講得再直白一點，便於你理解吧，妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，你現在是薩爾貢的領主，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我呢？我只是一個被家族放逐的流浪漢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但過個幾年，等到你不幸亡故，再由我親自去一趟巴耶勒王廷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既有血統，又帶著礦產和大筆財富向王酋表忠心，你覺得他會不會把長泉鎮重新分封給我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再好心地做一個假設，如果你上任沒多久就在一場血戰中喪生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把你的遺體獻給王酋，假若你有幸成為長生軍的一員，我會不會因此獲得更多好處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德魯奇，你這個卑鄙無恥的敗類！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼激動，妹妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，前述內容都只是我的假設，假設不會成真，這只是兄妹談心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我早就想好了更適合你的去處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到這些身上帶石塊的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你那麼願意保護感染者，不妨就加入他們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德魯奇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你因此而亡的時候，我會找個山洞把你填進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，你和老頭就能看著我是怎麼把礦洞底下深藏的源石挖出來，讓長泉鎮變成整個巴耶勒的礦產中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，不說話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在出賣你的家族，出賣這片土地！我詛咒你，德魯奇，你不得好死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你開心，我親愛的妹妹，你想咒多久就咒多久，趁你還有本事說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就這樣吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）你，過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）老闆，你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）把那些感染者帶到學者那邊去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）好的，我把他們帶給科學家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）這個年輕人呢？看起來快不行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）是死是活都帶過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）至於我妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）把她變成感染者，你們薩卡茲人肯定知道怎麼弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）不過這可不是合約規定的工作內容，得加錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）別那麼多廢話。往長遠看，等我們的事成了，礦山運作起來，有的是錢可分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真是有個好哥哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（閉上了眼睛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉起武器）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"還有敵人！架盾，保護頭兒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_7_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"頭兒，還有敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"領主衛隊的人不是都被幹掉了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看見了！我看見了！那是個......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_7"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"術師，快讓怪物動起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍等......我看看......這個要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"動作搞快一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！我的肩膀！我的肩膀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要慌亂，敵人在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒......沒看到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先撤退，敵人有弓弩，別待在空曠地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"掩護德魯奇老闆，他可不能出事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了！是個菲林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！撤退！撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你......你是羅德島的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"你還能動嗎，瑞柏巴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"源石畸變體","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，動起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她們沒有勝算的，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那老傢伙做的玩具也就這時候還有點用處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人和怪物一起上，把她們解決掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡敵人太多，我沒法保證能讓你平安離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的武器在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德魯奇能做到這一步都是我的疏忽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有臉面去見長眠的父親......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算死，我也要把這叛徒的心挖出來給長泉陪葬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"別衝動，敵人太多，這樣行動必死無疑，你需要為這座城鎮活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經給其他人發了信號，他們很快就到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，那些傭兵和羅德島的人正在攻擊我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼，這宅邸固若金湯，就憑幾個傭兵又能怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓術師操縱怪物幹掉那個菲林。其他人守住入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"